          "content": "One source argues that full grounding metaphysically necessitates what is grounded by appeal to cognitive significance and Fine-style essence, while the generalized-identity source explains grounding-to-necessitation patterns through what it is to be the grounded property or fact. The shared topic is not merely that grounding entails necessity, but that essence-like structure is used to explain why the entailment is metaphysically secure."
